The fix involves disabling the UIE timer before setting the RTC time and re-enabling it afterward. This ensures that the UIE timer is synchronized with the RTC, preventing the looping behavior in `rtc_timer_do_work` and ensuring that timers are managed correctly during the time-setting operation.

